{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-40","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-40"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-40-talk-403815052-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-40","missionId":"event-rogue-40","mission":"천외대합창","scene":"천외대합창","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"어느 록스타의 팬이 당신에게 오랫동안 소장해 온 오리지널 레코드판을 건넸다. 레코드판에는 수십 가지 다양한 소리가 담겨 있었다","talkId":403815052,"textHash":"11604644614524621357","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:40/talk-403815052","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aff7d635c9e831a5","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-40-talk-403815053-line"],"bwikiPage":"天外大合唱","bwikiRevision":57880,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8725","bwikiMission":"천외대합창"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-40-talk-403815053-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-40","missionId":"event-rogue-40","mission":"천외대합창","scene":"천외대합창","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「가장 시끄러운 로큰롤, 가장 신성하고 고전적인 랩, 가장 핫한 레트로 요소, 가장 화려하면서도 투박한 꾸밈음까지! 은하에서 유행하는 문화와 음식, 새롭게 출시한 라이어 게임 OST, 온갖 시대적 요소가 뒤섞인 소장용 레코드판!」","talkId":403815053,"textHash":"4872131760452853593","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:40/talk-403815053","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aff7d635c9e831a5","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-40-talk-403815054-line"],"bwikiPage":"天外大合唱","bwikiRevision":57880,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8725","bwikiMission":"천외대합창"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-40-talk-403815054-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-40","missionId":"event-rogue-40","mission":"천외대합창","scene":"천외대합창","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"화가 난 당신은 그가 분명 모순된 원소 조직에 속해 있을 거라 생각했다","talkId":403815054,"textHash":"2099027767563802678","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:40/talk-403815054","flowStatus":"review","bwikiS